     rreevv — reverse lines of a file

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     rreevv [_f_i_l_e _._._.]

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The rreevv utility copies the specified files to the standard output, re‐
     versing the order of characters in every line.  If no files are speci‐
     fied, the standard input is read.

EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
     Reverse the text from stdin:

           $ echo -e "reverse \t these\ntwo lines" | rev
           eseht    esrever
           senil owt

